{"synopsis":"Hidup ratusan tahun setelah bereinkarnasi menjadi pedang, aku menghabiskan seumur hidup hanya membereskan urusan orang lain.\n\nLalu tiba-tiba—aku merebut tubuh seorang pangeran pertama berandalan berusia lima belas tahun.\n\n“Berapa banyak anak yang sudah kubesarkan, coba.”\n\nKsatria agung yang dijuluki tidak terkalahkan, Dragon Slayer yang menumbangkan Naga Gila, Raja Tentara Bayaran—\n\nsemuanya adalah hasil didikanku.\n\nIblis Pedang Gruhon, yang merasuki tubuh pangeran pertama berandalan,\n\ndan mitos baru yang ia ukir kembali.","alternative_title":"망나니 1왕자가 되었다","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"2f7797c0-101f-4915-9432-039c5926a9d4","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"a0ae8021-e4db-48c0-9dd5-9334c358ee45","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"7eea5c34-1bec-4f5c-8ac3-a6930ed0b0f9","date":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"496f41c9-3b62-4406-ac0f-46af333472a8","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"7258fd10-4784-4058-81b0-a10dab9ee2a8","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"9bff5476-ee8a-408e-9aa4-6568bc3655fc","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"027109af-b9f2-4e95-afe0-640b01223a84","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"c97ea5cd-89ae-4c09-8660-397fb85f385b","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"ceaa00fb-10c9-474f-a12b-a4714fc7af58","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"076dd0c9-fc9f-4469-90a7-95341d5c1abb","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"69405e1d-1308-4d03-88b3-27cd70e114fe","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"8cd02690-f9eb-4f23-b841-788a6c476fc1","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"a9efb4e4-c460